      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua:200",
        "answer": "Hud_WZ directly constructs ReadyEvents and subscribes it to scriptNotify afterward. Builds ready notification images/text and scorestreak child, then registers state predicates: Hidden for any demo hidden/moviecam/EMP/no HUD or guided missile/killcam/remote streak/opaque bit/vehicle/flash/scoped/play-of-match/scoreboard/UI-active/no weapon-HUD; HiddenHacked requires hudItems.hacked>0; CodcasterHidden requires caster without enabled scorestreak-notification profile. Each relevant visibility/model/profile update reevaluates state. Constructor installs close then optional PostLoadFunc, calls ReadyEventsPostLoad last, returns self. It does not itself receive hero_weapon_received just because the caller registered a notification. Unselected class clips/close/postload helper are exact dependencies; native scriptNotify dispatch and effective HMH visibility remain open.",
